<Cell ss:StyleID="data"><Data ss:Type="String">SIROLIMUS (100MG/VIAL)</Data></Cell>
<Cell ss:StyleID="data"><Data ss:Type="String">1 INDICATIONS AND USAGE FYARRO ® is indicated for the treatment of adult patients with locally advanced unresectable or metastatic malignant perivascular epithelioid cell tumor (PEComa). FYARRO is an mTOR inhibitor indicated for the treatment of adult patients with locally advanced unresectable or metastatic malignant perivascular epithelioid cell tumor (PEComa). ( 1 )</Data></Cell>
</Row>
