<Cell ss:StyleID="data"><Data ss:Type="String">NELARABINE (250MG/50ML (5MG/ML))</Data></Cell>
<Cell ss:StyleID="data"><Data ss:Type="String">1 INDICATIONS AND USAGE Nelarabine Injection is indicated for the treatment of T-cell acute lymphoblastic leukemia (T-ALL) and T-cell lymphoblastic lymphoma (T-LBL) in adult and pediatric patients age 1 year and older whose disease has not responded to or has relapsed following treatment with at least 2 chemotherapy regimens. Nelarabine Injection is a nucleoside metabolic inhibitor indicated for the treatment of patients with T-cell acute lymphoblastic leukemia (T-ALL) and T-cell lymphoblastic l...</Data></Cell>
</Row>
<Row>
<Cell ss:StyleID="dataAlt"><Data ss:Type="Number">6</Data></Cell>
<Cell ss:StyleID="drugNameAlt"><Data ss:Type="String">CLEOCIN HYDROCHLORIDE</Data></Cell>
