<Cell ss:StyleID="data"><Data ss:Type="String">CYTARABINE (20MG/ML)</Data></Cell>
<Cell ss:StyleID="data"><Data ss:Type="String">INDICATIONS AND USAGE Cytarabine Injection in combination with other approved anti-cancer drugs is indicated for remission induction in acute non-lymphocytic leukemia of adults and pediatric patients. It has also been found useful in the treatment of acute lymphocytic leukemia and the blast phase of chronic myelocytic leukemia. Intrathecal administration of Cytarabine Injection (preservative free preparations only) is indicated in the prophylaxis and treatment of meningeal leukemia.</Data></Cell>
</Row>
