<Cell ss:StyleID="data"><Data ss:Type="String">1 INDICATIONS AND USAGE REZZAYO is an echinocandin antifungal indicated in adults and pediatric patients 12 years of age or older who have limited or no alternative options for the treatment of candidemia and invasive candidiasis. Approval of this indication is based on limited clinical safety and efficacy data for REZZAYO. ( 1 , 12.4 , 14 ) Limitations of Use REZZAYO has not been studied in patients with endocarditis, osteomyelitis, and meningitis due to Candida. ( 1 ) 1.1 Treatment of Candidem...</Data></Cell>
