<Cell ss:StyleID="dataAlt"><Data ss:Type="String">1 INDICATIONS AND USAGE SEROSTIM (somatropin) is indicated for the treatment of adults with HIV and wasting or cachexia to increase lean body mass and body weight, and improve physical endurance. Concomitant antiretroviral therapy is necessary. SEROSTIM is a human growth hormone (somatropin) indicated for the treatment of adults with HIV and wasting or cachexia to increase lean body mass and body weight, and improve physical endurance ( 1 )</Data></Cell>
