<Cell ss:StyleID="data"><Data ss:Type="String">1 INDICATIONS AND USAGE Epoprostenol for Injection is indicated for the treatment of pulmonary arterial hypertension (PAH) (WHO Group 1) to improve exercise capacity. Studies establishing effectiveness included predominantly patients with NYHA Functional Class III–IV symptoms and etiologies of idiopathic or heritable PAH or PAH associated with connective tissue diseases. Epoprostenol for Injection is a prostacyclin vasodilator indicated for the treatment of pulmonary arterial hypertension (PAH) ...</Data></Cell>
</Row>
