<Cell ss:StyleID="dataAlt"><Data ss:Type="String">ADALIMUMAB-AACF (40MG/0.8ML)</Data></Cell>
<Cell ss:StyleID="dataAlt"><Data ss:Type="String">1 INDICATIONS AND USAGE IDACIO is a tumor necrosis factor (TNF) blocker indicated for: • Rheumatoid Arthritis (RA) ( 1.1 ): reducing signs and symptoms, inducing major clinical response, inhibiting the progression of structural damage, and improving physical function in adult patients with moderately to severely active RA . • Juvenile Idiopathic Arthritis (JIA) ( 1.2 ): reducing signs and symptoms of moderately to severely active polyarticular JIA in patients 2 years of age and older. • Psoriati...</Data></Cell>
</Row>
