<Cell ss:StyleID="data"><Data ss:Type="String">INDICATIONS AND USAGE Pentazocine and Naloxone Hydrochloride Tablets are indicated for the management of pain severe enough to require an opioid analgesic and for which alternative treatments are inadequate. Limitations of Use Because of the risks of addiction, abuse, and misuse, with opioids, even at recommended doses, reserve Pentazocine and Naloxone Tablets for use in patients for whom alternative treatment options [e.g., non-opioid analgesics] • Have not been tolerated, or are not expected t...</Data></Cell>
</Row>
