<Cell ss:StyleID="dataAlt"><Data ss:Type="String">INDICATIONS AND USAGE PRED MILD ® is indicated for the treatment of mild to moderate noninfectious allergic and inflammatory disorders of the lid, conjunctiva, cornea, and sclera (including chemical and thermal burns).</Data></Cell>
</Row>
