<Cell ss:StyleID="dataAlt"><Data ss:Type="String">1 INDICATIONS AND USAGE JAVADIN is indicated for the treatment of hypertension in adult patients, to lower blood pressure. Lowering blood pressure reduces the risk of fatal and nonfatal cardiovascular events, primarily strokes and myocardial infarctions. These benefits have been seen in controlled trials of antihypertensive drugs from a wide variety of pharmacologic classes. There are no controlled trials demonstrating risk reduction with JAVADIN. Control of high blood pressure should be part of...</Data></Cell>
