<Cell ss:StyleID="dataAlt"><Data ss:Type="String">INDICATIONS AND USAGE Butalbital, Acetaminophen and Caffeine Capsules, USP are indicated for the relief of the symptom complex of tension (or muscle contraction) headache. Evidence supporting the efficacy and safety of this combination product in the treatment of multiple recurrent headaches is unavailable. Caution in this regard is required because butalbital is habit-forming and potentially abusable.</Data></Cell>
