<Cell ss:StyleID="dataAlt"><Data ss:Type="String">1. INDICATIONS AND USAGE VYSCOXA is indicated In adults for the management of the signs and symptoms of: VYSCOXA contains celecoxib, a nonsteroidal anti-inflammatory drug, and is indicated: In adults for • Osteoarthritis (OA) ( 1.1 ) • Rheumatoid Arthritis (RA) ( 1.2 ) • Ankylosing Spondylitis (AS) ( 1.3 ) In pediatric patients two years and older for • Juvenile Rheumatoid Arthritis (JRA) ( 1.4 ) Limitations of Use VYSCOXA must be administered on an empty stomach at least 2 hours before or 1 hou...</Data></Cell>
</Row>
