<Cell ss:StyleID="data"><Data ss:Type="String">1 INDICATIONS AND USAGE AVYCAZ is a combination of ceftazidime, a cephalosporin, and avibactam, a beta-lactamase inhibitor, indicated for the treatment of the following infections caused by designated susceptible Gram-negative microorganisms in adult and pediatric patients (at least 31 weeks gestational age): Complicated Intra-abdominal Infections (cIAI), used in combination with metronidazole ( 1.1 ) Complicated Urinary Tract Infections (cUTI), including Pyelonephritis ( 1.2 ) Hospital-acquired...</Data></Cell>
</Row>
