<Cell ss:StyleID="data"><Data ss:Type="String">1 INDICATIONS AND USAGE EMGALITY ® is a calcitonin-gene related peptide antagonist indicated in adults for the: preventive treatment of migraine. ( 1.1 ) treatment of episodic cluster headache. ( 1.2 ) 1.1 Migraine EMGALITY is indicated for the preventive treatment of migraine in adults. 1.2 Episodic Cluster Headache EMGALITY is indicated for the treatment of episodic cluster headache in adults.</Data></Cell>
</Row>
