<Cell ss:StyleID="data"><Data ss:Type="String">INDICATIONS AND USAGE Granisetron is indicated for the prevention of: Nausea and vomiting associated with initial and repeat courses of emetogenic cancer therapy, including high-dose cisplatin. Nausea and vomiting associated with radiation, including total body irradiation and fractionated abdominal radiation.</Data></Cell>
