<Cell ss:StyleID="dataAlt"><Data ss:Type="String">1 INDICATIONS AND USAGE Epinephrine is a non-selective alpha and beta adrenergic agonist indicated: To increase mean arterial blood pressure in adult patients with hypotension associated with septic shock ( 1.1 ) For emergency treatment of allergic reactions (Type 1), including anaphylaxis ( 1.2 ) 1.1 Hypotension associated with Septic Shock Epinephrine Injection, 1 mg/mL is indicated to increase mean arterial blood pressure in adult patients with hypotension associated with septic shock. 1.2 An...</Data></Cell>
