<Cell ss:StyleID="data"><Data ss:Type="String">CYTARABINE (100MG/ML)</Data></Cell>
<Cell ss:StyleID="data"><Data ss:Type="String">INDICATIONS AND USAGE: Cytarabine Injection in combination with other approved anti-cancer drugs is indicated for remission induction in acute non-lymphocytic leukemia of adults and pediatric patients. It has also been found useful in the treatment of acute non-lymphocytic leukemia and the blast phase of chronic myelocytic leukemia. Intrathecal administration of Cytarabine Injection (preservative free preparations only) is indicated in the prophylaxis and treatment of meningeal leukemia.</Data></Cell>
