<Cell ss:StyleID="data"><Data ss:Type="String">INDICATIONS AND USAGE Tromethamine Injection is indicated for the prevention and correction of metabolic acidosis. In the following conditions it may help to sustain vital functions and thus provide time for treatment of the primary disease: Metabolic Acidosis Associated with Cardiac Bypass Surgery. Tromethamine Injection has been found to be primarily beneficial in correcting metabolic acidosis which may occur during or immediately following cardiac bypass surgical procedures. Correction of Aci...</Data></Cell>
