<Cell ss:StyleID="dataAlt"><Data ss:Type="String">INDICATIONS AND USAGE Carefully consider the potential benefits and risks of etodolac tablets, and other treatment options before deciding to use etodolac tablets. Use the lowest effective dose for the shortest duration consistent with individual patient treatment goals (see WARNINGS ). Etodolac tablets are indicated: • For acute and long-term use in the management of signs and symptoms of the following: 1. Osteoarthritis 2. Rheumatoid arthritis • For the management of acute pain</Data></Cell>
