<Cell ss:StyleID="dataAlt"><Data ss:Type="String">INDICATIONS &amp; USAGE 1) Cholestyramine for oral suspension USP, light is indicated as adjunctive therapy to diet for the reduction of elevated serum cholesterol in patients with primary hypercholesterolemia (elevated low density lipoprotein [LDL] cholesterol) who do not respond adequately to diet. Cholestyramine for oral suspension USP, light may be useful to lower LDL cholesterol in patients who also have hypertriglyceridemia, but it is not indicated where hypertriglyceridemia is the abnormality...</Data></Cell>
