<Cell ss:StyleID="data"><Data ss:Type="String">1 INDICATIONS AND USAGE RHOPRESSA is indicated for the reduction of elevated intraocular pressure (IOP) in patients with open-angle glaucoma or ocular hypertension. RHOPRESSA ® is a Rho kinase inhibitor indicated for the reduction of elevated intraocular pressure in patients with open-angle glaucoma or ocular hypertension. ( 1 )</Data></Cell>
