<Cell ss:StyleID="data"><Data ss:Type="String">1 INDICATIONS AND USAGE RYZUMVI is indicated for the treatment of pharmacologically-induced mydriasis produced by adrenergic agonists (e.g., phenylephrine) or parasympatholytic agents (e.g., tropicamide). RYZUMVI is an alpha-adrenergic blocker indicated for the treatment of pharmacologically-induced mydriasis produced by adrenergic agonists (e.g., phenylephrine) or parasympatholytic agents (e.g., tropicamide). ( 1 )</Data></Cell>
