<Cell ss:StyleID="dataAlt"><Data ss:Type="String">EUGIA PHARMA</Data></Cell>
<Cell ss:StyleID="dataAlt"><Data ss:Type="String">1. INDICATIONS AND USAGE Mesna injection is indicated as a prophylactic agent in reducing the incidence of ifosfamide-induced hemorrhagic cystitis. Limitation of Use: Mesna injection is not indicated to reduce the risk of hematuria due to other pathological conditions such as thrombocytopenia. Mesna injection is a cytoprotective agent indicated as a prophylactic agent in reducing the incidence of ifosfamide-induced hemorrhagic cystitis. ( 1 ) Limitation of Use: Mesna injection is not indicated t...</Data></Cell>
</Row>
