<Row>
<Cell ss:StyleID="drugName"><Data ss:Type="String">OSELTAMIVIR PHOSPHATE</Data></Cell>
<Cell ss:StyleID="data"><Data ss:Type="String">OSELTAMIVIR PHOSPHATE</Data></Cell>
<Cell ss:StyleID="data"><Data ss:Type="String">07/09/2025</Data></Cell>
<Cell ss:StyleID="data"><Data ss:Type="String">New Drug Application</Data></Cell>
<Cell ss:StyleID="data"><Data ss:Type="String">SHANDONG</Data></Cell>
<Cell ss:StyleID="data"><Data ss:Type="String">1 INDICATIONS AND USAGE Oseltamivir phosphate capsule is an influenza neuraminidase inhibitor (NAI) indicated for: Treatment of acute, uncomplicated influenza A and B in patients 2 weeks of age and older who have been symptomatic for no more than 48 hours. (1.1) Prophylaxis of influenza A and B in patients 1 year and older. (1.2) Limitations of Use: Not a substitute for annual influenza vaccination. (1.3) Consider available information on influenza drug susceptibility patterns and treatment effe...</Data></Cell>
</Row>
