<Cell ss:StyleID="dataAlt"><Data ss:Type="String">INDICATIONS AND USAGE Primaquine phosphate Tablets are indicated for the radical cure (prevention of relapse) of vivax malaria.</Data></Cell>
</Row>
<Row>
<Cell ss:StyleID="drugName"><Data ss:Type="String">LUMRYZ</Data></Cell>
