<Cell ss:StyleID="data"><Data ss:Type="String">1 INDICATIONS AND USAGE LUMRYZ is indicated for the treatment of cataplexy or excessive daytime sleepiness (EDS) in patients 7 years of age and older with narcolepsy. LUMRYZ is a central nervous system depressant indicated for the treatment of cataplexy or excessive daytime sleepiness (EDS) in patients 7 years of age and older with narcolepsy ( 1 ).</Data></Cell>
</Row>
