<Cell ss:StyleID="dataAlt"><Data ss:Type="String">1 INDICATIONS AND USAGE Buprenorphine Sublingual Tablets are indicated for the treatment of opioid dependence and are preferred for induction. Buprenorphine sublingual tablets should be used as part of a complete treatment plan to include counseling and psychosocial support. Buprenorphine sublingual tablets contain buprenorphine, a partial opioid agonist, and are indicated for the treatment of opioid dependence and are preferred for induction. ( 1 ) Buprenorphine sublingual tablets should be use...</Data></Cell>
</Row>
