<Cell ss:StyleID="dataAlt"><Data ss:Type="String">INDICATIONS Butalbital, Aspirin, and Caffeine Capsules is indicated for the relief of the symptom complex of tension (or muscle contraction) headache. y and safety of Butalbital, Aspirin, and Caffeine Capsules in the treatment of multiple recurrent headaches is unavailable. Caution in this regard is required because butalbital is habit-forming and potentially abusable.</Data></Cell>
</Row>
