<Cell ss:StyleID="dataAlt"><Data ss:Type="String">1 INDICATIONS AND USAGE Donepezil hydrochloride is indicated for the treatment of dementia of the Alzheimer&apos;s type. Efficacy has been demonstrated in patients with mild, moderate, and severe Alzheimer&apos;s disease. Donepezil hydrochloride is an acetylcholinesterase inhibitor indicated for the treatment of dementia of the Alzheimer&apos;s type. Efficacy has been demonstrated in patients with mild, moderate, and severe Alzheimer&apos;s Disease ( 1 ).</Data></Cell>
