<Cell ss:StyleID="data"><Data ss:Type="String">INDICATIONS &amp; USAGE Lidocaine Hydrochloride Injection, USP administered intravenously is specifically indicated in the acute management of 1) ventricular arrhythmias occurring during cardiac manipulation such as cardiac surgery, and 2) life-threatening arrhythmias, particularly those which are ventricular in origin, such as those which occur during acute myocardial infarction.</Data></Cell>
</Row>
