<Cell ss:StyleID="data"><Data ss:Type="String">Supplemental</Data></Cell>
<Cell ss:StyleID="data"><Data ss:Type="String">ACCORD HLTHCARE</Data></Cell>
<Cell ss:StyleID="data"><Data ss:Type="String">INDICATIONS AND USAGE: For adjunctive treatment of: chronic simple (open-angle) glaucoma, secondary glaucoma, and preoperatively in acute angle-closure glaucoma where delay of surgery is desired in order to lower intraocular pressure. Acetazolamide extended-release capsules are also indicated for the prevention or amelioration of symptoms associated with acute mountain sickness despite gradual ascent.</Data></Cell>
</Row>
